==Serbo-Croatian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/rǎːditi/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|ра|ди|ти|lang=sh}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}}. Cognate with Bulgarian {{m|bg|радея||care for}}, Russian {{m|ru|радеть||care for}}. Non-Slavic cognates include Ossetian {{m|os|рад||order}}, Sanskrit {{m|sa|राध्यते||tr=rāhyate}}, {{m|sa|राधति||tr=rādhati}} and {{m|sa|राध्नोति||tr=rādhnoti|succeed}}, Gothic {{m|got|𐌲𐌰𐍂𐌴𐌳𐌰𐌽|tr=garedan}}.

===Verb===
{{sh-verb|head=ра́дити|c|ráditi|a=impf}}

